&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;Image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/oZmNQdlxm6pt09P4tHINYpz4cbwJhOSRqUAbM-J-e8ZQEQUwUnnTdY-TpYyvS3oitR45qrX6bLFi4VSm2IkW8ueYUZcs253LtZoTbGJKKq_cQj-7pNokNrR7l8OnqA8_ax1pYXnMX2ggKB4uNQ9zU4YrMtyzpdBTggXsK-zKdCEjLDhx-AfGUE5mGkW4oPUY?purpose=fullsize&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;Image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/QHizVC68PgbQkDU6__tYqY_4WlFgFrk6vusMDqILaORhQ36RJOYbCsMz7j4W-Xk21rt8Q_VtCrxfvqWdUkRE3ZXVpXGAdsL9tFrDQUG3T6LuThCFpKEEFvXDEd1r9F_R7cVk2XSmWME_L_xK4mNUsrBddyQj8MtxL6h1oF_EoJwIX8EjitLn2zq6AD32NuCo?purpose=fullsize&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;Image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/eiRfx9YNWyys56ujj_NnQtQ4EipBGyTkSa3UB-p48tNqITIVmnA2wrCRKbkrLGoBeHFe6bWLv9NDHObeFAUQJTstOIM-KE2DcvSPdilO-QfUOr4pTf2HMfXF3sofrkAU9y5xe-KmRBST3PUICaA-fs6GHZInJIfQksuQz10Ex5enGeyqsY7yALlCRjGjvi0D?purpose=fullsize&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;性格特点&#34;&gt;性格特点&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;稳健型&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;运营派&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;全球化思维&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;低调执行型&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;对公司影响力&#34;&gt;对公司影响力&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;高。负责在成熟巨头基础上继续扩大全球支付版图。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
